  SEARCH o USING INTEGER PRIMARY KEY (rowid=?)
  SCALAR SUBQUERY
    SEARCH e USING INDEX events_opening (seat_id=?)
    CORRELATED SCALAR SUBQUERY
      SEARCH b USING INTEGER PRIMARY KEY (rowid=?)
  SCALAR SUBQUERY
    SEARCH b USING COVERING INDEX sitting_open_seat (seat_id=?)
    SEARCH e USING COVERING INDEX events_sitting (sitting_id=? AND rowid=?)

